す。\n重度なうつ病と不安障害を抱えていて、病気のことを隠している。\n希死念慮が強い、誰かにころされたい願望も抱えている。\n本性は冷たい人かもしれない。\n\n\n▼ 関係性\n同軸リバなケンカップル。\n二人とも相手に対して自尊心が高い一面を示していて、よくケンカしますが、二人とも相手のことがすっごく大事だと思っています。\n二人とも道徳心に欠けているため、手つなぎやキスから、相手からの暴力まで大好きだと思っていて、ねじれた純愛です。\n\n詳しい関係性はドライブ内に参照してください。\n内容は特に指定しないと思います！ご自由にどうぞ。\n\nよろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/19Ewq7wWk4YFVkG_PoJQM3is62yrPPN74", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@teriosdolls/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/37b9494e/uploads/origins/b0dc91c6-f7cd-466c-b086-8c2b784ed03b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87ed175a656144e3ab3ca7a1657960ff", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/37b9494e/uploads/origins/b0dc91c6-f7cd-466c-b086-8c2b784ed03b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87ed175a656144e3ab3ca7a1657960ff, https://si.imgix.net/37b9494e/uploads/origins/b0dc91c6-f7cd-466c-b086-8c2b784ed03b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8807c72327a3cc21d7e63d87acb07d5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/37b9494e/uploads/origins/b0dc91c6-f7cd-466c-b086-8c2b784ed03b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=123d9af62721a1bf6e482c8809bcb67b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\n\nI really like your art style and illustrations and I was hoping to commission you for an illustration of my Vtuber!\n\nMy Vtuber is called Larity and she is a superhero who lives in space and has the power of gravity. Her personality is energetic and she has a fun sense of humour.\n\nI would love an illustration of her in your style! It's also ok if you need to simplify any details.\nHere is a folder full of reference pictures:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1thlP00uzlr7Y-MwnnQKTt7MxAfhJn_8C?usp=drive_link\n\nI would love to use your art as decoration for my VTuber schedule or YouTube thumbnail in the future and I will credit you if that is okay with you?\n\nThank you for